<h1>New Funding Opportunity Submitted</h1>

<p>A new funding opportunity has been submitted and is awaiting approval:</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Title:</strong> <%= @funding_opportunity.title %></li>
  <li><strong>Organization:</strong> <%= @funding_opportunity.organization %></li>
  <li><strong>Deadline:</strong> <%= @funding_opportunity.deadline.strftime("%d %B %Y") %></li>
  <li><strong>Submitted by:</strong> <%= @funding_opportunity.created_by&.email_address || "Unknown" %></li>
</ul>

<p>
  <%= link_to "Review pending funding opportunities", admin_funding_opportunities_url %>
</p>
